From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bornaradusin <bornaradusin@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 10:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 103/103] PC5: Direct3D 11 textures loaded as shader resource views
 (Wine patch 0982)

D3DX11CreateShaderResourceViewFromMemory was a stub, and its FromFile and
FromResource siblings were not exported: Dragon Ball Xenoverse 2 loads
its textures that way, got none, showed a black screen and crashed.
---
